            ],
            "action/13/then/0": [
              {
                "path": "action/13/then/0",
                "timestamp": "2026-07-10T16:00:18.723628+00:00",
                "result": {
                  "params": {
                    "domain": "notify",
                    "service": "persistent_notification",
                    "service_data": {
                      "message": "Set: 22.5C Mode: cool Fans: kitchen=off, master=2, mina=2, guest=off, izaan=2 Vents: Iz=80% Mi=40% Blinds: {\"dining\":100,\"family\":100,\"living\":100,\"mina\":100} - It is Friday midday (Mid-Peak rate). Outdoors is 22.9C and cloudy (56.2%), so blinds are kept 100% open per the cloudy rule. Maintaining HVAC cool mode at 22.5C. Ceiling fans in occupied/warm upstairs rooms (Master, Mina, Izaan) are set to speed 2 to aid circulation. Izaan's room is warmest at 22.8C, so its vent booster is maintained at 80%.",
                      "title": "Climate AI: 22.5C cool"
                    },
                    "target": {}
